# Optional explicit PLC-MAC (preferred) or REM BDA -> canonical Xymon host.
# Two fields per entry, or three with "occasional" for an adapter that is
# only plugged in now and then (never flapping, never forgotten); "-" as
# host marks it without mapping it. No trailing comments. Multiple adapters
# mapping to one host aggregate by worst color, preserving per-MAC metrics.
# 02:00:00:00:00:0C garage.lan occasional
# F0:B0:14:84:C5:3C powerline1.lan
# E8:DF:70:1D:65:A6 powerline3.lan
